## Build / install / runtime verify

The canonical recipe is in `<docs-hub>/00_shared-rules/verify-build.md`. Quick reference:

```bash
# Doctor — verify environment once per session
flutter doctor

# Build (Debug APK; iOS use --debug --no-codesign on simulator)
flutter build apk --debug
# verify: https://docs.flutter.dev/reference/flutter-cli

# Install + run on connected device
flutter install
flutter run --release  # or --profile for perf work

# Runtime log
flutter logs > .ai-workspace/diag/$(date +%Y-%m-%d)-${TASK}-log.txt

# Screenshot
flutter screenshot --out .ai-workspace/screenshots/$(date +%Y-%m-%d)-${TASK}-after.png

# Lint
flutter analyze
dart format --set-exit-if-changed lib/
```

