## Diagnostic tools (Flutter)

| Tool | Use case |
|---|---|
| Flutter DevTools (browser-based) | CPU / memory / widget tree / network |
| `flutter run --profile` | Frame timing breakdown in DevTools |
| `flutter doctor` | Environment validation |
| Observatory / VM Service | Dart-level profiling |
| Underlying platform tools (`adb`, `idevicesyslog`) | When the issue is below the Flutter layer |

